OL,3,GNEWSAChecks carried out on dryer linked
OL,4,Ato fatal fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tumble dryer importer urged to carry
OL,7,Fout a safety review after one of its
OL,8,Fappliances was linked to a fatal house
OL,9,Ffire has said the model in question
OL,10,Fdoes not pose an "elevated" safety
OL,11,Frisk.
OL,13,FSohaib Ahmed and his daughter, Manahal
OL,14,FNazir Ahmed, died when a fire broke out
OL,15,Fat their West Yorkshire home, with
OL,16,Ftheir DX C10DCER-80 Hoover condenser
OL,17,Ftumble dryer deemed "more likely than
OL,18,Fnot" to be the cause.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
