OL,3,GNEWSAChecks carried out on dryer linked
OL,4,Ato fatal fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing an inquest coroner Martin
OL,7,FFleming called on Haier Smart Home UK
OL,8,FLtd to investigate, saying 1.6 million
OL,9,Fother machines may share the model's
OL,10,Fcharacteristics.
OL,12,FIn response, the company said it had
OL,13,Fcarried out extensive tests on all
OL,14,Fsimilar units and found "no systemic
OL,15,Fsafety issue".
